# S14z, guest g (a k10 character): the title gives it the room story at game start (empty: revision 0), so it plays the
# lobby's first visit; its lobby progress (the phase step, 501, ...) goes up while the owner has not started the story:
# refused not_started and dropped (with the notice once). Its barrier into stag0101 removes those values from its engine
# (501 is 0 there) and tells it why.
campaign until stage=stagml11
talk until control,frames>=60
log guest in the lobby
idle until frames>=900
explore mate00 yes until stage=stag0101,control
log guest in the field
idle until frames>=120 fail flag:501=1
log 501 removed
idle until frames>=60
